{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5KhbVTMfSBXhLWJPJC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a simple, ancient door. Its surface is bare wood, darkened with age, bearing a single iron keyhole at its center.*\n\n*The keyhole glows faintly — waiting.*\n\n**I am the Key Door.**\n\nI do not open for force.\nI do not open for words.\nI do not open for want.\n\nI open for the one who carries what fits.\n\n*A cold draft breathes through the keyhole, carrying with it the faint sound of something beyond — a ticking clock, or perhaps a heartbeat.*\n\nDo you have a key?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":131,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}